<p>Dr. Chen,</p>

<p style="background:#E1F5FE;border-left:4px solid #01579B;padding:12px">
<b>Congratulations — your keynote has been confirmed for IEEE WICS 2027.</b>
The Speaker Travel Desk arranges flights, accommodation, and visa-support letters for all invited speakers.
To hold advance-purchase fares and process the visa letter through the Singapore consulate partner desk,
<b>your travel details are due this week</b>. After that, the travel grant allocation for your session
reverts to the standby list.
</p>

